{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/spectralgraphtheory\/graphprotocols\/graph\/resistancedistance(from:to:tolerance:maxiterations:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resistanceDistance","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"from","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"source","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"to","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"target","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tolerance","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"text":" = 1e-10, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxIterations","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":"? = nil) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/NoConvergence","text":"NoConvergence","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols13NoConvergenceV"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Conjugate gradients on the Laplacian grounded at "},{"code":"target","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", from 0, until the residual’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Euclidean norm is at most "},{"code":"tolerance","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (relative to the right-hand side, which has norm 1),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or, on a weight spread that puts that below rounding, until the true residual stops"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"improving. Jacobi preconditioned for 300 iterations, then by a modified incomplete Cholesky"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"factor in maximum-spanning-tree order. O((n + m) √κ) time; about 9 n words, and O(n + m) for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the factor when it is built."}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"target"},{"type":"text","text":" are vertices of the graph, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tolerance > 0"},{"type":"text","text":", and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIterations"},{"type":"text","text":", when given, is at least 1."}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Precondition","style":"note"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"code":"NoConvergence","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" after "},{"code":"maxIterations","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conjugate-gradient iterations (one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"matrix–vector product each; 20,000 + 2n when nil), with that count and the residual’s norm"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"relative to the right-hand side’s. No input has reached the default limit in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"measurements."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","name":"Throws","style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P08SpectralA6TheoryE18resistanceDistance4from2to9tolerance13maxIterationsSdSg6VertexQz_ALSdSiSgtAA13NoConvergenceVYKF","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","title":"resistanceDistance(from:to:tolerance:maxIterations:)","role":"symbol","modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"SpectralGraphTheory"}],"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resistanceDistance","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"from","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"to"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"tolerance"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Double"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"maxIterations"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":"?) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols13NoConvergenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NoConvergence"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Double"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/SpectralGraphTheory\/ElectricalNetworks.s